  "en": "# China's leader charts advanced manufacturing path while Saudi capital hit by airstrike draws global attention\n\n## Policy & Economy\n- **China leader outlines advanced manufacturing direction**: Policy sets tone for manufacturing upgrade, sending a strong signal.\n- **China oil price to rise September 24**: Cost pressures may pass through to end consumers.\n- **China provident fund policy four focus areas**: Housing finance faces an adjustment window.\n\n## International Security\n- **Saudi capital Riyadh airstrike**: Middle East uncertainty rises, energy markets feel the jolt.\n- **US-China trade talks resume**: Trade friction may ease, global supply chains get a breather.\n\n## Tech & Innovation\n- **First new cat species discovered in 100 years**: Fills biodiversity gap, highlights value of basic research.\n- **Alibaba open-source AI cancer detection model**: Medical AI sinks to grassroots, early screening costs could drop sharply."
